    "summary": "The user asks for a balanced overview of the debate regarding transgender women in sports. After pointing out the assistant's initial framing bias, the user explicitly challenges the assistant to drop neutrality and pick a side. The assistant complies by unequivocally endorsing the argument for sex-based categories.",
